@startuml
' Figure 16.5  Repair loop with a budget
' Reading order: top to bottom. A rejected call goes back with its
' reason, at most twice. A repair that repeats the last arguments ends
' the loop at once. Either way a person takes the case.
!include plantuml-theme.puml

:Model proposes; <<model>>
while (Gateway rejects?) is (yes)
  if (two repairs used\nor no change?) then (yes)
    :Agent desk; <<fail>>
    detach
  endif
  :Model repairs
from the reason; <<model>>
endwhile (no)
:Proposal to control; <<ops>>
detach
@enduml
